# Cursor treats every AGENTS.md and CLAUDE.md as a rule. Skill copies of those
# names were injected into every chat. The on-demand entry is SKILL.md; the
# long React guides live in REFERENCE.md. Ignore the rule filenames if a
# skill rebuild writes them back.
.agents/skills/**/AGENTS.md
.agents/skills/**/CLAUDE.md

# Claude Code keeps .claude/skills. Cursor already loads .agents/skills and
# .cursor/skills, so the Claude copies are a second catalog.
.claude/skills/**

# Nested benchmark checkouts carry their own skill trees.
benchv2/**/.agents/**
benchv2/**/.claude/**
